From 053445bbf650883155ed0a9d5e46224c184889ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 22:09:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(trading): round lock state and server rejection toasts

Handles the new battleLocked socket event: the trade buttons switch to LOCKED and
are disabled until the next round starts (also honoured when the snapshot carries
locked: true). Server-side order rejections (ROUND_LOCKED, BATTLE_FROZEN,
ORDER_FREEZE, LAST_SECOND_SNIPE_LOCK, throttling, insufficient balance) now show a
toast instead of being dropped silently. The snapshot UI signature includes locked
and trader_count so those changes reach the store.

